[[File:Bossk_arms.png|thumb|250px|Trandoshans like [[Bossk'wassak'Cradossk|Bossk]] were reptilian sentients.]]
{{Quote|How do I ''look''?''"<br />"Sss''. You look ''exactly'' like a middle-aged scoundrel with a thing for ''reptiles'' getting sweaty over a new ''client''.|[[Winloss]] and [[Nokk]]|<ref name="Doctor Aphra (2016) 27">[[Doctor Aphra (2016) 27|''Doctor Aphra'' (2016) 27]]</ref>}}
'''Reptiles''' (adjectival form '''reptilian''') were a class of lifeforms exemplified by the [[dewback]]s,<ref name="DBdew">{{Databank|dewback|Dewback}}</ref> the [[Rodian]]s,<ref name="DBrod">{{Databank|rodian|Rodian}}</ref> the [[dalgo]]s,<ref name="DBdal">{{Databank|dalgo|Dalgo}}</ref> the [[Trandoshan]]s,<ref name="DBtra">{{Databank|trandoshan|Trandoshan}}</ref> and the entity known as [[Orphne]].<ref name="DBorp">{{Databank|orphne|Orphne}}</ref> The [[planet]] of [[Dagobah]] was home to a number of quite common reptilian creatures.<ref name="Dbdag">{{Databank|dagobah|Dagobah}}</ref> One particular category of reptiles were the '''lizards''', examples of which included the [[tauntaun]]s,<ref name="Dbtau">{{Databank|tauntaun|Tauntaun}}</ref> the mysterious [[Zillo Beast]],<ref name="Dbzil">{{Databank|zillo-beast|Zillo Beast}}</ref> the [[brezak]]s,<ref name="Dbbre">{{Databank|brezak|Brezak}}</ref> and the [[varactyl]].<ref name="Dbvar">{{Databank|varactyl|Varactyl}}</ref><ref name="Dbbog">{{Databank|boga|Boga}}</ref> Some [[species]], such as [[Hutt]]s, were considered '''reptiloid'''.<ref name="JMM1">[[Star Wars Jedi Master Magazine 1|''Star Wars Jedi Master'' Magazine 1]]</ref>

[[Sentience|Non-sentient]] reptiles were used for various purposes by the more intelligent species of the [[The galaxy|Galaxy]]. Due to their great strength and toughness, species like [[Orray|orrays]], tauntauns and [[Ronto|rontos]] were used for the transport of people and loads. Other reptiles, like [[Massiff|massifs]], were trained for guard duty or to track enemies. For those seeking extreme pets, reptiles offered some exciting choices such as the [[rancor]] and [[roggwart]]; however, nobody could tame the most fearsome reptiles, including the zillo beast and [[dragonsnake]].<ref name="VE">''[[Star Wars: The Visual Encyclopedia]]''</ref>

